cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Il Plebiscito della Mosca"
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it — and cite BANC
  (Bates et al., Nature 2026) and the Shiu et al. 2024 LIF
  constants if you use the circuit pack or the simulator.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Bert
    given-names: Davide
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/dcbert/plebiscito-della-mosca
url: https://dcbert.github.io/plebiscito-della-mosca/
abstract: >-
  Satirical web app: a real BANC v888 fruit-fly circuit votes
  on Italian XIX-legislatura motions. The fly never reads the
  bill. We classify the text; the connectome answers the stimulus.
keywords:
  - Drosophila
  - connectome
  - BANC
  - leaky integrate-and-fire
  - Italian Parliament
  - satire
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: Distributed control circuits across a brain-and-cord connectome
  authors:
    - family-names: Bates
      given-names: Alexander S.
    - family-names: Phelps
      given-names: Jasper S.
    - family-names: Kim
      given-names: Minsu
    - family-names: Yang
      given-names: Helen H.
    - name: "et al."
  year: 2026
  journal: Nature
  doi: 10.1038/s41586-026-10735-w
